{"connections":{"HMS: Check Subscription":{"main":[[{"index":0,"node":"Reply via HMS","type":"main"}]]},"HMS: List Doctors":{"main":[[{"index":0,"node":"Reply via HMS","type":"main"}]]},"Intent Switch":{"main":[[{"index":0,"node":"Reply via HMS","type":"main"}],[{"index":0,"node":"Reply via HMS","type":"main"}],[{"index":0,"node":"HMS: List Doctors","type":"main"}],[{"index":0,"node":"Reply via HMS","type":"main"}],[{"index":0,"node":"HMS: Check Subscription","type":"main"}]]},"Parse & Route":{"main":[[{"index":0,"node":"Intent Switch","type":"main"}]]},"Reply via HMS":{"main":[[{"index":0,"node":"Respond 200","type":"main"}]]},"WhatsApp Incoming":{"main":[[{"index":0,"node":"Parse & Route","type":"main"}]]}},"name":"HMS WhatsApp Bot Router","nodes":[{"id":"webhook-in","name":"WhatsApp Incoming","parameters":{"httpMethod":"POST","options":{},"path":"hms-whatsapp","responseMode":"responseNode"},"position":[240,300],"type":"n8n-nodes-base.webhook","typeVersion":2,"webhookId":"hms-whatsapp-incoming"},{"id":"parse","name":"Parse & Route","parameters":{"jsCode":"// Input from HMS: { hospitalId, conversationId, from, text, humanOwns }\nconst { hospitalId, conversationId, from, text, humanOwns } = $input.first().json;\nconst t = (text || '').toLowerCase().trim();\nlet intent = 'unknown';\nif (humanOwns) intent = 'human_owned';\nelse if (/^(hi|salam|hello|aoa|assalam|menu)/.test(t)) intent = 'menu';\nelse if (t === '1' || t.includes('book') || t.includes('appointment')) intent = 'book_start';\nelse if (t === '2' || t.includes('timing') || t.includes('fee') || t.includes('doctor')) intent = 'doctor_info';\nelse if (t === '3' || t.includes('human') || t.includes('receptionist')) intent = 'handoff';\nelse if (t === 'doctor' || t.includes('dard') || t.includes('pain') || t.includes('bukhar') || t.includes('fever')) intent = 'ai_doctor_check';\nelse if (/^(yes|confirm|jee|han)/.test(t)) intent = 'confirm_yes';\nelse if (t.includes('cancel')) intent = 'cancel';\nreturn [{ json: { hospitalId, conversationId, from, text, intent } }];"},"position":[460,300],"type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","typeVersion":2},{"id":"switch","name":"Intent Switch","parameters":{"options":{"fallbackOutput":"extra","renameAllOutputs":false},"rules":{"values":[{"conditions":{"conditions":[{"id":"c1","leftValue":"={{ $json.intent }}","operator":{"operation":"equals","type":"string"},"rightValue":"menu"}],"options":{"caseSensitive":false}},"outputKey":"menu","renameOutput":true},{"conditions":{"conditions":[{"id":"c2","leftValue":"={{ $json.intent }}","operator":{"operation":"equals","type":"string"},"rightValue":"book_start"}],"options":{"caseSensitive":false}},"outputKey":"book","renameOutput":true},{"conditions":{"conditions":[{"id":"c3","leftValue":"={{ $json.intent }}","operator":{"operation":"equals","type":"string"},"rightValue":"doctor_info"}],"options":{"caseSensitive":false}},"outputKey":"doctors","renameOutput":true},{"conditions":{"conditions":[{"id":"c4","leftValue":"={{ $json.intent }}","operator":{"operation":"equals","type":"string"},"rightValue":"handoff"}],"options":{"caseSensitive":false}},"outputKey":"handoff","renameOutput":true},{"conditions":{"conditions":[{"id":"c5","leftValue":"={{ $json.intent }}","operator":{"operation":"equals","type":"string"},"rightValue":"ai_doctor_check"}],"options":{"caseSensitive":false}},"outputKey":"ai_doctor","renameOutput":true}]}},"position":[680,300],"type":"n8n-nodes-base.switch","typeVersion":3},{"id":"get-doctors","name":"HMS: List Doctors","parameters":{"headerParameters":{"parameters":[{"name":"Authorization","value":"=Bearer {{ $env.HMS_API_TOKEN }}"}]},"method":"GET","options":{},"sendHeaders":true,"url":"={{ $env.APP_URL }}/api/v1/doctors"},"position":[900,140],"type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","typeVersion":4},{"id":"check-sub","name":"HMS: Check Subscription","notes":"Extend: add /patients/by-phone + subscription check endpoint in HMS, then branch to AI intake vs upsell.","parameters":{"headerParameters":